        "name": "Executioner",
        "skill": "Lunge Strike: a heavy blow dealing 180% AD.",
        "skill2": "Bloodthirst: gains attack speed and lifesteal for a short time.",
        "passive": "Execute: basic attacks deal bonus damage to low-HP enemies. On takedown, gains move and attack speed."
      }
